    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87272" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεν-δημέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be in</i> a place or <i>among</i> a people
